--Subject: [PATCH] issue #299: quick-add 'No issue' mode to start an agent
-- without an issue
--
--Add a 'No issue' checkbox to the quick-add bar that hands the typed text
--straight to a coding agent as its prompt (reusing the ad-hoc agent path)
--instead of creating an issue. In that mode the provider/Create-PR controls
--stay live and the redundant 'Assign agent' toggle is disabled.
--
--Also make the issue-created confirmation more descriptive, naming the new
--number and title ("Issue #N created: ...") instead of a bare "Issue created."
--
--Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
